# Blueberry Blackwater for Konsole. Blueberry tint of Blackwater: dark, neutrals leaned toward blueberry (base 13,21,41).
# Generated by build.mjs from src/ports/konsole.colorscheme. Do not edit ports/konsole/.
# Copy into ~/.local/share/konsole/, then Settings > Edit Current Profile > Appearance.
#
# Colour 0 to 7 and their Intense pair are the same ANSI mapping kitty and Ghostty
# use. Konsole also wants a Faint variant, which Darkberry has no role for, so each
# one is mixed 40% toward the background.

